Gaster.DisplayName: Mysterious Man

Dialogue: {
	Admin: {
		GoblinDialogue: I'm studying anomalies daily to get a proper grasp on what is happening, {0}'s ability to scam the same person multiple times might be related.
		GenericDialogue1: It's such a tragedy how easily something can go wrong, even if you don't expect it. Just look at this world, so many problems all at once.
		GenericDialogue2: Magic Mirrows tend to react weirdly to certain enegies, especially a certain iridescent pink one. I know that a patch of it appeared somewhere on this continent, I just don't remember where exactly.
		GenericDialogue3: I've had a weird feeling since a while, it's as if everything could go mad any second...
		GenericDialogue4: Sometimes I ponder if he is still waiting for me... Oh apologies, I was absorbed in thought, do you need anything.
		GenericDialogue5: I would love to introduce you to the great team of multidimensional heroes that I work with, they are probably pretty busy right now though.
		GenericDialogue6: Ever had a problem where you became incredibly rich because of frogs and crackers? Well let me tell you about that one time where... What? What's that look supposed to mean, I'm telling the truth!
		GenericDialogue7: So how is this world? Having fun? Any suggestions for improvement? Haha I'm joking of course, I already spent 48 tries and several millenia to make this one. I also forgot my admin password.
		GenericDialogue8: I could have sworn that Angel Statue flipped me off one time. What do you mean 'what statue?', it's right over th- Alright I think living for this long has turned my brain to mush.
		GenericDialogue9: You cannot imagine how badly I want to eat some pizza right now, but this world is too primitive to have invented a pizza oven yet, and mine is out of reach. Maybe I could craft one in my forge?
		GenericDialogue10: Have you ever questioned what's beyond the stars? What vast world lies out there? Well, if you did, then stop. It's for the better to not know anything.
		GenericDialogue11: Thanks again for powering that beacon, I couldn't have come here to help without it. What its name is supposed to mean? Of course it means 'Caelis Number-48 Version-01 Data Transfer Beacon'. Though I do prefer to just call them Baby Tower.
		GenericDialogue12: I hope I can fix everything somehow...
		GenericHardmodeDialogue1: Just between us two, if you happen to possess a sword made of fish, try throwing it into some weird liquid.
		MushroomDialogue: I had a dream where you showed me all of these alchemy mushrooms in a glowing mushroom biome while shopping with me. I think you did that after defeating a weird stone construct powered by solar energy.
		SerpentAscendDialogue: I heard that in its dying moments, a serpent will ascend to become a wyrm. Maybe it's an act of mercy, an apology from their ancestors for stripping them of their primal forms. Truth or not, it is a beautiful thought to hold onto.
		ImposterDialogue: Oh hey, that's a cool name you got there, reminds me of someone. Oh? You are feeling weird? You must have eaten something bad.
		#Below is help dialogue
		ColdHellHelp: Somewhere in the western edge of the underworld caverns we detected some sort of breach. The most concerning part about it is the fact that energy itself becomes stagnant around that area. It's worth investigating, but we should be careful.
		DimensiumHelp: You can find Dimensium by doing many different things. Killing, mining, fishing, and so much more.
		KingsCapHelp: You know that mushroom forest nearby? If you wait long enough, you may find a mushroom that is larger than the others. You may wake it up using a unique fungus only found in that forest.
		TouchGrassHelp: Go outside
		#Below is quest dialogue
		FlashQuestStart: Hey, I thought you could help me out right now, I need some objects for something important. If you were to bring me 10 Frost Scales, 2 mice and around 5 Dimensium that would be great. What do I need them for? Well... I can tell you, if you bring me these things.
		FlashQuestClear: Thank you so much! With this I could create a magic construct in the image of one I miss alot. Here, you can take him with you for a while, he might be a nice little support.
		#Below is tpose dialogue
		Tpose: Help me, I'm stuck.
	}

	Taraha: {
		GenericDialogue1: Hello, welcome, trade rarities?
		GenericDialogue2: *eldritch gibberish*
		GenericDialogue3: Madness is lurking, be careful.
		GenericDialogue4: The LIGHT, so bright, so bright!
		GenericDialogue5: You ask why acorns needed? Taraha has to plant lots of acorns. Taraha wants own woods, big trees, many trees.
		GenericDialogue6: Has human ever tried finding sparkly soup? Sparkly soup somewhere behind humid place with stingy insects. Need to dig deep.
		GenericDialogue7: Taraha love this dimension, so much energy, feels comfy.
		GenericDialogue8: Taraha sees many persons here petting small fluffy creature. Taraha not know why food is being pet.
		GenericHardmodeDialogue1: Taraha traded wax for superpowerful relic the other day. Funny man thought wax was holy blood from deity.
		GenericHardmodeDialogue2: Taraha feel so many different signatures around. Why so many people here who don't belong?
		AdminDialogue: "{NPCName} is good friend, traded much with Taraha, always give yummy crystal."
		DapperDialogue: Taraha talked to small mushroom boy about mushrooms earlier. Taraha really wanted lollipop but boy didn't want to trade for anything Taraha provided. Taraha is suffering, wants lollipop.
		BloodMoonDialogue: Taraha will bite hand off if human keeps staring.
		SlimeRainDialogue: Yum yum, gelatin heaven!
		ShadeItemDialogue: Shaded eye, Taraha can smell it. Belongs to friend, friend must be very trusty to give you gift like this. Say hello for Taraha when human meet friend.
		LollipopDialogue: Taraha can feel it. Human has lollipop. Give! Give now!
		SmileyDialogue: The king, empty, alone, withering...
		FeudalDialogue: Taraha know Umos, bad influence, he speak nonsense!
	}

	Dappercap: {
		FatherDialogue: DAD, GET THE HELL AWAY FROM HERE!
		UncleDialogue: OMG uncle, hi!
		ClothTruffleDialogue: So, sometimes I see {0} sneak into {0}'s house at night. You think there is something going on between them?
		AldinDialogue: I once met this awesome mushroom enthusiast, he was pretty chill and cool. He told me he wanted to find 7 mushrooms to do whatever, probably bend space-time or something. Anyways, he disappeared without a trace and I have not seen him since then.
		RocketDialogue: So I talked to this guy once who really seemed to like mushrooms, it was a nice conversation until he mentioned he preferred my dad over my uncle. I was like 'DUDE HOW?' and he kept going with how awesome he is. I told him to shroom himself and left him alone with a moldy one, hope the smell unrots his brain.
		GenericDialogue1: My uncle is so cool, unlike my boring as hell dad. He EVEN GLOWS, can you believe that??
		GenericDialogue2: Hey between you and me, I'm pretty sure my uncle is a hallucinogenic!!
		GenericDialogue3: I had this friend of mine named Malcolm, I got several awesome mushrooms from him, but then he suddenly stopped, saying something like "I have to be a better person". Bleh... weirdo.
		GenericDialogue4: Dem mushromz hit hart todai
		GenericDialogue6: Sometimes my dad was so annoying that I told him to finally go get some milk.
		GenericDialogue7: I heard there is a kingdom full of mushroom people, but it's not ruled by a mushroom, do you think it's real?
		GenericDialogue8: Yo, would be awesome if you were to meet my uncle. If you bring me like, 5 of these Hovercaps, I'm going to give you something that will definitely draw his attention. Why I need those caps? Well I find it really funny to use them as a frisbee.
		GenericDialogue8B: So, my uncle thought you killed my dad and stole the ring. That is very unfortunate, but tell ME. Did you two have an epic fight? Did you? Did you?
		#Below is Alch Mushroom dialogue
		TradeSuccess1: Yo awesome, take these for your work.
		TradeSuccess2: Thanks, my other contact will really appreciate these!
		TradeFail1: Idk if you understand the concept of trading but you do indeed need to give me something of interest, this isn't god damn donation central.
		TradeFail2: Hello? You understand me? You need to give thingie so I give thingie. So GET your ass out unless you need something important.
		MadnessTrade: HOLY COW! I have no idea where you found this but these mushrooms are EXTREMELY rare. There is only one species in my possession that I could give you for such a beauty.
		DyeItemTrade: Oh thanks, how did you know I was hungry?
		GlowTrade: Alright, here ya go bro. I stole this from my dad to sell it but apperantly it belongs to my uncle. Try to give it back so you two can get to know eachother!
		#Below is first time talk dialogue
		FirstTalk1: I saw you gave my dad a good thrashing, so I guess you're cool.
		FirstTalk2: Yes bro, you don't know how much I hate that guy, hope he went to cry in a corner. I'm Deadly Dappercap btw, the deadliest fungus in town, I love to get around and gather some really funky shrooms. Let's say you bring me some valuable things and I'll give you some of them. But if anyone asks, they aren't from me, understood?
		FirstTalk3: Good to know. So you bring me rare fauna and I give you some pricey fungi, that or you buy them for a Dapper deluxe price.
		#Below is box dialogue
		Box: Ey, go away, you are going to reveal my location if you keep talking to me. I will not come out until I know its safe again.
		#Below is reality shroom event dialogue
		AldinGrab1: I don't even know this mushroom, thats how rare it must be. It makes me feel weird though, so I'm not sure if I want this. WHAT THE HECK!?
		AldinGrab2: Well... that was something I guess.
	}

	VanillaNPCDialogue: {
		Truffle: {
			Dapper1: My brother Malcom, always talked about little Dappercap when he visited. But then he eventually stopped showing up, and not even dapper knows where he is now. He just said Malcom was gonna make amends for his crimes.
			Dapper2: Despite his looks and behavior, Dappercap is the scarlet prince. But even with this title and the respect he gains from it, he ran away and never returned home. Even Umos is in mild distraught by this.
			Umos1: Our glowing royalty, Umos, he is what keeps us going, that light in the dark. While I don't 100% agree with his ways, he is still our light.
			Umos2: It is really scary to be granted sentience out of nowhere. I felt lost at first, but then I was guided by a light, it was his light. These are times of peace for my kin, something not many have.
			Umos3: Many creatures in the dark caverns come to our glowing sanctuaries. Those often bear hostility however, which makes them intruders rather than guests. Somehow Umos sees them as worthy, saying that all deserve salvation.
			UmosDead: I know you defeated our apostle in battle. I have no grudge against you, it must have been a misunderstanding. He can be very defensive against outsiders.
			Unimush1: I feel like something is pulling at my mind recently, it makes me very uneasy...
			Unimush2: Since recently I hear my brother call to me from afar sometimes, but when I look, there is nobody there.
			Unimush3: My nightmares have gotten worse, I feel like everyone wants to consume me.
		}

		Wizard.Carces: I once heard of a settlement called Carces. Apperantly it was a humble town that was famous for its so called 'Twin Libraries', which would contain ancient manuscripts. I would love to get my hands on some of those, but sadly the town was burned down many years ago.
	}
}

AdminTpose.DisplayName: Admin Tpose

Admin: {
	TownNPCMood: {
		Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is such a fascinating person, he always shows me those amazing magic devices he has. One was even able to conjur up plates with heated dough on it."
		LikeNPC_Princess: The small pink lady, yes {NPCName}. I feel weirdly at ease when I'm around her, so at ease in fact that I accidentily keep telling her things that nobody's supposed to hear.
		HateNPC: I can't stand being near {NPCName}, he reminds me of long forgotten sins.
		DislikeNPC: "{NPCName} always wants to discuss spells with me and keeps calling me a fellow wizard. I'm not a magician, I'm a scientist!"
		LoveNPC: I'm glad that {NPCName} was able to come here too, she is a very valuable member for our cause. I would also not forgive myself if something bad happened since she is personal protection.
		LikeNPC: I like {NPCName}. She is a great help for some of my experiments, even if she doesn't understand half of it.
		HateBiome: I should go somewhere else, whenever I have a thought´it gets disrupted by these god damn pixies, they are SO noisy.
		DislikeBiome: This tundra is such an awful place for my machinery. The energy flow just keeps slowing due to the cold.
		LikeBiome: Being underground is doing a good job for me. Not many interferences happening to disturb any experiment.
		LoveBiome: Ahh, the forest, it's so perfect. Beautiful, quiet and perfectly tempered.
		HateCrowded: I hate how many people are around. It's too reminiscent of the old times.
		DislikeCrowded: It's starting to get a little full around here
		LoveSpace: It's really nice having time to think alone sometimes, the large amount of space really contributes.
		FarFromHome: Not having the ability to teleport by myself is so tedious. My place is SO far away.
		NoHome: Now that you summoned me, I'm in desperate need of a place to stay, you got anything?
		Content: I feel alright.
	}

	DisplayName: Administrator
}
